    "regime_notes": "Positive in 2020-2022 (IC 0.049261, ICIR 0.147443), weaker in 2023-2025 (IC 0.011037, ICIR 0.036775), and positive again in 2026-2031 (IC 0.037515, ICIR 0.115080). Small cross-asset universe warrants conservative interpretation.",
